  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Voices Our Futures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Voices, Our Futures (OVOF) is a global South-led consortium, comprising CREA, the  Arab Foundation for Freedoms and Equality (AFE), the Association for Progressive  Communications (APC), UHAI &#x2014; The East African Sexual Health and Rights Initiative and  WO=MEN. Consortium partners are complemented by strategic partner IM-Defensoras, a  Mesoamerican women&#x2019;s human rights defenders (WHRDs) organisation.</narrative>
  </description>
